flowchart TD
    Start([Message Received]) --> Idempotency{Already<br>Processed?}
    Idempotency -->|Yes| Ack[ACK & Skip]
    Idempotency -->|No| Process[Process Message]

    Process --> Deserialize[Deserialize Event]
    Deserialize --> Validate{Valid?}
    Validate -->|No| Ack
    Validate -->|Yes| Business[Execute Business Logic]

    Business --> DB{DB Operation<br>Success?}
    DB -->|No| Retry{Retry Count<br>< 5?}
    Retry -->|Yes| Backoff[Exponential Backoff<br/>1s → 2s → 4s → 8s → 16s]
    Backoff --> Process
    Retry -->|No| DLQ[Move to Dead Letter Queue]
    DLQ --> Nack[NACK Message]

    DB -->|Yes| Mark[Record ProcessedMessage]
    Mark --> ACK[ACK Message]
    ACK --> End([End])

    Nack --> End
    Ack --> End

    classDef decision fill:#f39c12,color:#fff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef process fill:#3498db,color:#fff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef terminal fill:#2ecc71,color:#fff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px
    classDef error fill:#e74c3c,color:#fff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px

    class Idempotency,Validate,DB,Retry decision
    class Process,Deserialize,Business,Backoff,Mark process
    class Start,End terminal
    class DLQ,Nack,Ack,ACK error
